{"purpose":"Validasi feasibility 'deploy ke server langsung dari local' via SSH untuk single VPS/bare-metal dengan full lifecycle Anvil (build→verify→install→activate) tanpa CI, sebagai riset sebelum commit jadi req/adr.","content":"# Findings — Deploy Langsung dari Local (FND)\n\n## 1. Problem Statement\nSolo dev / small team butuh `anvil deploy` dari laptop ke VPS tanpa menunggu CI. Ownership Anvil tetap: lifecycle convention + verification + state tetap di server, trigger saja yang CI-agnostic (ADR-003 § deterministic lifecycle). Bukan \"copy file mentah\".\n\n## 2. Alternatives Considered\n- **A. Local-triggered full lifecycle (rekomendasi riset):** Laptop build artifact (manifest.json embedded, identity from content), push via SSH (scp/rsync), lalu invoke `anvil server install/activate` di target via SSH. Verification-before-trust tetap gate sebelum activate. Rollback first-class. Sama dengan CI path, beda trigger.\n- **B. Direct copy + symlink (rejected):** Cepat lokal tapi violate verification-before-trust \u0026 state-before-assumptions, no rollback semantics. Ditolak — contradict ADR-003.\n- **C. Preview-only channel:** A untuk dev/preview env, prod tetap CI. Hybrid yang aman — bisa jadi scoping decision dari riset ini.\n\n## 3. Architecture Sketch (untuk spike)\n- CLI: `anvil deploy --target \u003cenv\u003e` membaca anvil.yaml `project.standard` + `server.targets[env]` (host, user, sshKeyPath).\n- Transport: SSH + artifact streaming (tar.gz). Negotiate (deployment.Negotiate) cek capability declaration adapter sebelum install.\n- Server: Coordinator.Install(projectID, artifactPath) + Activate(projectID, releaseID) di remote via SSH exec. State tetap di server runtime (`/.anvil` state), `anvil status` queryable.\n- Auth: SSH key dari local agent, tidak simpan secret di repo. Opsional ssh-agent forwarding.\n- Idempotency: Jika deploy terputus, retry harus aman — install idempotent, activate hanya jika verify PASS.\n\n## 4. Constraints In Force\n- vis:anvil-manifesto, adr:003 (deterministic lifecycle), adr:006 (state), adr:016 (deployment model), spec:lifecycle-model, spec:verification-contract, spec:artifact-manifest.\n\n## 5. Evidence Required to Approve\n- Spike 1: SSH transport latency \u0026 retry test (distribusi 50 artifact push ke VPS dummy).\n- Spike 2: e2e local→VPS: BuildRelease local → push → Install→Verify→Activate → `anvil status` + Rollback.\n- Spike 3: Race test local-vs-CI concurrent deploy (state locking).\n- Spike 4: UX review `anvil deploy` output \u0026 error handling (network failure, auth fail).\n\n## 6. Open Questions\n- Apakah perlu `anvil deploy --dry-run` yang hanya build+verify tanpa install?\n- Env promotion: `dev` boleh dari local, `prod` harus guard (confirm prompt + allowlist)?\n- Registry vs direct: artifact tetap publish ke registry lokal atau langsung stream?\n\n## 7. Recommendation\nLanjut spike 2 minggu, lalu decide: jika spike PASS → promote ke req:local-deploy (Discovery) + adr:local-deploy-transport (Architecture) + scp:local-deploy-mvp (Planning).\n","investigationSummary":"Gate 1-2 EKA Planning Discussion 2026-08-25 (mode: solo). Topic: deploy dari laptop ke server. Decision Gate1: full lifecycle, SSH single target, FND-first. Gate2 constraints: vis:anvil-manifesto (§4 domain ownership, §10 principles), ADR-003 deterministic lifecycle, ADR-016 deployment model server/hybrid, verification-before-trust, identity-from-content, state-before-assumptions. Architect assessment: impact Discovery→Architecture→Planning→Execution→Operations, dependencies spec:lifecycle-model / verification-contract / artifact-manifest + server/coordinator + deployment/negotiate. Trade-off menang: (A) full lifecycle via SSH konsisten philosophy, (B) bypass rejected. Risks: SSH secret management, network idempotency, state drift local-vs-CI race, audit trail.","conclusion":"FND merekomendasikan spike 4-item di atas. Belum approved untuk implementasi — butuh evidence PASS + review sign-off sebelum naik stratum. Draft state tetap draft."}